          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: प्रारंभ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रारंभ — prārambh — \"a commencement\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कार्यक्रमाचा प्रारंभ गाण्याने झाला. kāryakramācā prārambh gāṇyāne jhālā. The programme began with a song."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The formal word for सुरुवात."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रारंभ (prārambh) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit prārambha, 'a commencement, a beginning' (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
