              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अंत — ant — \"an ending; an end\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "या कथेचा अंत फार अनपेक्षित होता. yā kathecā ant phār anpekṣit hotā. The ending of this story was very unexpected."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शेवट is the everyday word; अंत (ant) is also the end of a life."
            }
          ]
        },
